# Business Requirements Document

## Business Objective
Develop a proposed AI-assisted subcontractor document intake and tracking workflow.

## Functional Requirements

| ID | Requirement |
|---|---|
| BR01 | Capture unique document ID and subcontractor information. |
| BR02 | Identify document category. |
| BR03 | Flag missing information. |
| BR04 | Track document status and completeness. |
| BR05 | Route exceptions for human review. |
| BR06 | Display operational KPIs in Tableau. |
| BR07 | Support filtering by department and document type. |

## Non-Functional Requirements
- Protect confidential business information.
- Maintain human oversight of approval decisions.
- Ensure dashboard metrics are understandable.
- Maintain traceability of status changes in a future implementation.

## Out of Scope
Live ERP integration, automated legal compliance decisions and production deployment.
